 "_source": "Remaster data for a Phantasie II import from the C64 copy alone (profile p2-c64, v1.2), applied by the importer (OpenPhantasie.Importer.Pipelines.P2C64.P2C64Tables). Built by tools/scripts/build_c64_p2_import.py from the C64 v1.2 disks and the Atari ST's data. Numbers and the manual's spell names only; no text from the game disks.",
